        <DisplayName>Manta VI-X</DisplayName>
        <Description>Experience the ultimate in aerial combat with the Manta VI-X. This formidable fighter is designed to dominate the skies, capable of hunting down and neutralizing enemy aircraft with unmatched precision. Equipped with advanced AI, the Manta VI-X can lead and command a squadron of fighters, ensuring victory in any engagement. Witness the future of warfare with Volsung Industries.</Description>
